        {
          "id": "f2",
          "label": "Paragraph",
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Curious about clear aligners? Invisalign SmileView offers a complimentary online simulation of how your smile might look, and your suitability is confirmed at a consultation. DentiCare payment plans are also available for eligible patients. Details are on our Prices and Payment Options page."
